  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.68,
      482.0,
      282.04,
      545.6
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice to the public under subsection (1) ofthe Section (7) of the Land Acquisition Act, as amendedby the Land Acquisition Act (amendment) No. 28 of 1964the land/servitude described below is required by thegovernment and the government intends to acquire thesaid land for public purpose :-",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      64.8,
      556.87,
      265.8,
      566.95
    ],
    "text": "Description of the land/ servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      55.68,
      578.48,
      281.95,
      706.16
    ],
    "text": "Schedule - 01 including the block of land and boundariesdescribed below for an extent of 0.0119 Hectares accordingto the supplementary tenement list relevant to thepreliminary plan B 508 dated 24.08.2018 and to thepreliminary plan B 508 dated 27.10.1999, prepared by theBadulla District Senior Superintendant of Survey for theSurveyor General, situated in Badulla Central village(within Badulla Municipality), Division No. 10,Kendelagama coming under 78 B Badulla East GramaNiladhari Division, of the Minor Division of RilpolaKorale, in Badulla Divisional Secretary Division ofBadulla District in the Province of Uva.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      316.32,
      346.92,
      373.42,
      357.0
    ],
    "text": "Block No. 04",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      368.24,
      547.5,
      459.2
    ],
    "text": "Name of the land: Pandithagedara watte and Radalawatte,Assessment Number 3A, Post Office Road; Description ofthe land: Road(part); Claimant: State; Original Claimant: 4thblock of land of P.P.B. 508. Verified after clearing theboundaries. Acquired under the Section 38(A) of the LandAcquisition Act. Original claimant is Lilian Peiris of No. 17,Peiris Mawatha, Kalubowila, Dehiwala. For the completion ofacquiring; Extent: 0.0119 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      474.08,
      547.09,
      520.16
    ],
    "text": "All those who claim ownership, interest and any otherconnection to aforesaid land, should appear personally, orby agents duly authorized in writing before me at DivisionalSecretariat, Badulla on 05.11.2018 at 10.30 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      307.2,
      534.08,
      547.15,
      592.16
    ],
    "text": "In addition, hereby requested to notify to me in writing withtwo copies of the nature of their interests in the land/lands,the particulars of their claims for compensation for theacquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation andthe details of computation of such amount before 22.10.2018.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.078991889953613
    ]
